            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What's new in CapyBar 1.0.1</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Eyes, nose, and mouth stay black on the capybara, and flip to white only when the body color is too dark to read.</li>
  <li>Sampling and menu bar redraws use less CPU while CapyBar stays open all day.</li>
</ul>
